{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":false,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true},"description":"DiligenceOps: check an invoice or payment record against the job or mandate it claims to belong to. Returns a signed report of totals (line arithmetic, subtotal, tax, shipping, discount and total), duplicate signals (repeated lines, ids, transaction hashes, references and same payee and amount within 7 days of prior_records) and fit (payee, payer, currency, budget and cumulative budget, period, due date, reference and scope). Exact decimal arithmetic. POST /api/invoice-check. Paid URL: 0.10 USDC per call on Base via x402 exact, with the shared 10 signed-wallet free calls per rolling 30 days. Bind X-Wever-Wallet-Proof to the exact JSON arguments and the tool route. Returns a report with an Ed25519 signed receipt. Contract: /api/diligence-contract. Human page: https://weverlabs.com/diligence/.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"belongs_to":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"budget_max":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number"},{"pattern":"^-?(?:0|[1-9][0-9]{0,17})(?:\\.[0-9]{1,18})?$","type":"string"}]},"currency":{"pattern":"^[A-Za-z]{3,5}$","type":"string"},"id":{"maxLength":200,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"kind":{"enum":["job","mandate"]},"payee":{"anyOf":[{"pattern":"^0x[0-9a-fA-F]{40}$","type":"string"},{"maxLength":200,"minLength":1,"type":"string"}],"description":"Wallet address or name."},"payer":{"anyOf":[{"pattern":"^0x[0-9a-fA-F]{40}$","type":"string"},{"maxLength":200,"minLength":1,"type":"string"}],"description":"Wallet address or name."},"period_end":{"description":"ISO date or datetime with a timezone.","pattern":"^20[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}(?:T[0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2}(?:\\.[0-9]{1,3})?(?:Z|[+-][0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2}))?$","type":"string"},"period_start":{"description":"ISO date or datetime with a timezone.","pattern":"^20[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}(?:T[0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2}(?:\\.[0-9]{1,3})?(?:Z|[+-][0-9]{2}: